# Neon — project Avelcc, branch dev
#
# TWO STRINGS, DELIBERATELY. STACK-AND-RESOURCES:192 flags this twice as the
# thing that trips people: drizzle-kit fails confusingly against the pooler.
#   DATABASE_URL         pooled   -> the app
#   DATABASE_URL_DIRECT  direct   -> drizzle-kit migrations only
DATABASE_URL="<pooled>"
DATABASE_URL_DIRECT="<direct>"

# GitHub OAuth. Absent is legal — the login page renders OAUTH_NOT_CONFIGURED.
GITHUB_CLIENT_ID=
GITHUB_CLIENT_SECRET=
